{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1032.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"e395fd23fc8d39caf297d29bdc52d6092cb91423e9dd137f94023f05a0bc57bf","ja":"最後の企画","zh":"最后的企划","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1032.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"5488741a8d4bde05e8893998e3f6d6152be5dd8be060c39ec3603ebb4a0f4ac7","ja":"リレー小説のラスト、女の子が幸せいっぱいで\n私も笑顔になれたよ！　千早ちゃん、お疲れさま！","zh":"接力小说的结尾，女孩子满是幸福的样子，\n让我也露出了笑容呢！千早，辛苦啦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1032.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"6c27e9645bb5bc09954bc6bbe309ce3af1de27781f44bdd8ecc92045eaa8463c","ja":"よかった……みんなが、バトンをしっかり\n繋いでくれたおかげです。","zh":"太好了……多亏了大家\n把接力棒稳稳地传递了下去。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1032.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"f61d0086304268ce16ad44c1cedbb0c93a6019ff55b63e292e2d24534a108452","ja":"ふふっ♪　この調子で、最終回もどっかーんって\n盛り上げたいね♪","zh":"呵呵♪　照这个势头，最后一集也要轰轰烈烈地\n炒热气氛呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1032.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"f586c6ea24475a9a8b28defd634a295c4d7e0f6297a37ea9fee75df23db6b038","ja":"はい！　それで、\n『フレッシュクリエイト』第4回目ですが……。","zh":"好的！那么，\n关于《Fresh Create》第4期……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1032.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"576c5715af3f7966b6dc1523afb5e86751132e18c582b3e5a2c18bcdf1cb773a","ja":"『同人誌制作』です！\nなんと、雑誌の付録になるそうなんですよ！","zh":"是“制作同人志”！\n而且据说是要作为杂志的附录呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1032.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"b812c9d8fa6c9a434f8d31e743a989e797f3dfe1ba85be34cb33b89436771148","ja":"同人誌かぁ。この前、サークルのお手伝いをさせて\nもらったけど、アタシたちだけで作るなんて……！","zh":"同人志啊。之前去给社团帮过忙，\n但只靠我们自己来做的话……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1032.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"20f8ce3a40486024ed8f4d66d3aa48a5701a376ccb5888d5c00940aa5e2ce8e2","ja":"でもせっかくなら、好きなものを\nぎゅぎゅっと詰め込みたいな♪","zh":"但既然难得做一次，好想把喜欢的东西\n满满当当地塞进去呀♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1032.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"85c219a5123b2b9a821fb2868727bca86818c1f09cfdf44f71523cd004a7f24e","ja":"そうですね！　あ、でも……。","zh":"确实呢！啊，不过……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1032.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"59453f2d3bc55617c57b81d22a54367ccf8aac45620180fb7926ab6edec0c4e2","ja":"どうしようかな……。やりたいことはあるんですけど、\nちゃんと伝わるようにまとめられるかどうか……。","zh":"该怎么办呢……。想做的事情是有的，\n但不知道能不能好好整理出来，完整传达给大家……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1032.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"e1f4558b5f5ada3a62f58e5a90f92f3f7b327b8ffc9a995c5ce5b001ebf6515a","ja":"きっとなんとかなるよ！\nだって好きなものを作るんだし、パワーは無限大だよ♪","zh":"总会有办法的！\n毕竟是做自己喜欢的东西，动力可是无限大的哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1032.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"cc37d5be06fd9726b41fc04bca0fffdb9beb59df55d1e6d45ef85725adebdd70","ja":"はい。以前取材した服飾科やサークルの皆さんも、\n好きなことのために頑張ってましたし。","zh":"是的。之前采访过的服装科和社团的各位，\n也都在为了自己喜欢的事情而努力呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1032.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"929d56ab89a79deec8e94ccbae82257696012f2c67f6c1762625bb458f9607b3","ja":"私もリレー小説のとき、楽しもうって考えたら、\n素直に書けたので。","zh":"我也是在写接龙小说的时候想着去享受它，\n才能顺其自然写出来的。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1032.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"42a3732970e87ab7e8592d76062372ff8bfc0fd550ef643b1a4ad7047b4dc5f7","ja":"……そうですね。\n私、やってみます！","zh":"……你说得对。\n我试着做做看！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1032.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"28bc80ded9a67ed580cfa118d97cae019d73699df73c4aa6c482111aa6e7f214","ja":"そうと決まったら、\nさっそく準備に取り掛からなくっちゃ！","zh":"既然决定了，\n就得赶快开始着手准备了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
